  unitName: Lux Halcyon Atro
  unitId: 50017
  unitNumber: 1306
  description: If the Six Heroes had succeeded in repelling the gods, perhaps Atro,
    like the teacher he so revered, would have set out on his own sojourn, traveling
    the lands and teaching others his unique style of swordsmanship. Always more
    concerned about the futures of children than of himself, it's likely he would
    have inspired many children to become practitioners not only of his school of
    swordplay, but also his ideology and ethics. It's not difficult to imagine the
    name of "Holy Knight Atro" being handed down from generation to generation.
  summonDesc: Think not of accolades, but take pride in the job itself. I finally
    realized what that means to me. I wonder what it meant to him...
  fusionDesc: Explore the world and broaden the mind. I know it's not our original
    mission...but it always excites me nonetheless!
  evoDesc: We must create a future for our children. It won't do to just protect
    them now. We must teach them to live!
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
